  const spellPresets = [{"id":"petty-curse","name":"Curse","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":1,"range":"12 yards","duration":"until dispelled","ingredients":"hair, fingernail or similar from victim","description":"This spell allows the caster to place a Curse on one chosen victim, who must be within 12 yards when the Curse is made. The victim may test against Will Power, but if this is failed, the curse takes effect. A curse can be removed automatically by the original caster, or by another spellcaster of a higher level, using a Remove Curse spell."},{"id":"petty-gift-tongues","name":"Gift of Tongues","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":1,"range":"hearing","duration":"1+ turns","note":"1 MP per turn.","description":"This spell affects the caster only, enabling the speaking and understanding of any language heard. The effects last for 1 tum per magic point expended, and may be extended at the cost of further points."},{"id":"petty-glowing-light","name":"Glowing Light","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":1,"range":"touch","duration":"1+ hours","note":"1 MP per hour.","description":"the caster This spell is cast on one object, which the caster must be holding. The object glows brightly, giving off light equivalent to that cast by a lantern (see Light and Darkness). The light lasts for 1 hour but this duration can be extended by the expenditure of further magic points."},{"id":"petty-magic-alarm","name":"Magic Alarm","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":2,"range":"touch","duration":"until triggered","description":"This spell can be cast on any spoJ the caster wishes. Should any living creature pass within 1 yard of it, the caster will be made aware that this has happened - even to the point of w:aking up if alseep at the time - no matter how far away the' event takes place. The caster knows only that something has disturbed the spell,  and will not be aware of any other details."},{"id":"petty-magic-flame","name":"Magic Flame","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":1,"range":"personal","duration":"until extinguished","description":"None -,"},{"id":"petty-magic-lock","name":"Magic Lock","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":3,"range":"1 yard","duration":"1+ weeks","note":"3 MP per week.","description":"This spell can be cast on any lock or bolt within 1 yard of the caster. An enchanted lock/bolt cannot ever be picked or forced open, but will remain solidly firm. However, the spell does not prevent someone from smashing down a magically locked door, for example, and magically locked chests could still be broken open."},{"id":"petty-marsh-lights","name":"Marsh Lights","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":1,"range":"—","duration":"1 hour","ingredients":"2 fireflies","description":"This spell creates the appearance of a number of lights, as of disS.-sltant torches or lanterns. The lights appear within 100 yards of,r7-il1 \u0003{\u0004Jl 153 the caster, and can then be sent off in any desired direction. They naturally follow corridors or paths, and do not need to be controlled or overseen in any way."},{"id":"petty-open","name":"Open","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":3,"range":"1 yard","duration":"instantaneous","description":"This spell can be cast against any lock, bolt or latch within 1 vard, and causes it automatically to unlock, unbolt or lift. The locks or whatever, will remain opened for the next minute, and cannot be forced shut again during this time. This spell will not work on a magically locked bolt, lock or latch."},{"id":"petty-produce-small-creature","name":"Produce Small Creature","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":2,"range":"personal","duration":"—","description":"This spell allows the character magically to produce a small animal from a hat or pocket. The creature is a normal member of its species, and may be eaten if it is normally edible. Magicians must randomly determine the type of creature produced by the spell - whenever they use this spell, that type of creature always appears."},{"id":"petty-protection-rain","name":"Protection from Rain","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":1,"range":"personal","duration":"1 hour","description":"This spell stops rain from falling on the caster. Even in the heaviest downpour the character remains perfectly dry. The effects last for 1 houi; or until dispelled by the caster."},{"id":"petty-reinforce-door","name":"Reinforce Door","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":3,"range":"1 yard","duration":"1+ weeks","note":"3 MP per week.","description":"This spell can be cast on any door, chest or similar vessel within 1 yard to make it physically tougher, and thus harder to break open. The door or vessel will gain one point of Toughness. Up to three spells ( + 3 Toughness) can be cast on any one door or vessel."},{"id":"petty-remove-curse","name":"Remove Curse","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":1,"range":"touch","duration":"instantaneous","description":"The caster can remove a curse placed by another caster of the same level or lower. Only one curse can be removed at a time."},{"id":"petty-sleep","name":"Sleep","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":2,"range":"touch","duration":"D6 turns","description":"This spell can be cast upon any single character the caster can touch - the victim need not know that a spdl is being cast. The victim must make a test against Will Power or fall into a comatose sleep for D6 game turns. This spell only works against a single, humanoid creature under ten feet tall - it has no affect' against Iarser creatures."},{"id":"petty-sounds","name":"Sounds","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":1,"range":"within hearing","duration":"1 round","description":"This spell causes a sound of some kind to occur. This can be a very loud noise, which echoes over a great distance (up to half a mile in the open, more underground), or a very soft noise, such as heavy breathing. The caster may choose the type of noise and the volume; the spell can produce any kind of noise except speech."},{"id":"petty-zone-cold","name":"Zone of Cold","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":1,"range":"personal","duration":"1 hour","description":"This spell creates a 12-yard diameter Zone centred around the caster. The Zone lasts for an hour, until it is destroyed, or until the caster moves. Within the Zone the temperature is lowered by ten degrees centigrade."},{"id":"petty-zone-silence","name":"Zone of Silence","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":1,"range":"personal","duration":"1 hour","description":"This spell creates a 12-yard diameter Zone, centred on the caster. The Zone lasts for an hour, until it is destroyed, or until the caster moves. No sound will pass into or out of the Zone, no matter how loud."},{"id":"petty-zone-warmth","name":"Zone of Warmth","school":"Petty Magic","level":"P","magicPoints":1,"range":"personal","duration":"1 hour","description":"the caster. The Zone lasts for an hour, until it is destroyed, or until the caster moves. Within the Zone temperature is raised by ten degrees centigrade."},{"id":"battle-magic-aura-of-resistance","name":"Aura of Resistance","school":"Battle Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"Aura spells provide protection against Wounds by increasing the number of armour points on each part of the casting character's bodyby +l. Auras may be dispelled by magical means (eg, Dispel Aura), and are automatically dispelled by bits from magical weapons, so are not a guarantee of invulnerability. Characters may only bear one Aura at any one time, and may dispel their own Aura whenever they wish."},{"id":"battle-magic-cause-animosity","name":"Cause Animosity","school":"Battle Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can be cast against a group of characters or creatures that are normally subject to animosity, such as Goblins. The creatures must make a test against Will Power to resist the spell's effects. If unsuccessful, they attack each other until the appearance of any other creatures that they would normally regard as enemies, at which point the spell is instantly broken."},{"id":"battle-magic-cure-light-injury","name":"Cure Light Injury","school":"Battle Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can be used to heal the caster or one other character or non-magical creature by touch. The spell takes effect immediately, restoring 06 Wounds to the character. This spell will not heal a character suffering from heavy wounds (less than two remaining Wounds)."},{"id":"battle-magic-fire-ball","name":"Fire Ball","school":"Battle Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"Characters casting this spell can literally throw a ball of fire at their enemies, causing a great deal of damage and consternation. Only one fire ball per level may be thrown per combat round. Each spell must be targeted at the same character or group of characters or creatures. 'Iargct restrictions apply in the same way as for normal missile fire (see Targeting Spells)."},{"id":"battle-magic-flight","name":"Flight","school":"Battle Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"this spell the cast.er is endowed with magical flight. The charact.er can immediat.ely fly 48 yards in any direction desired, but cannot fly through walls or solid objects. A charact.er may continue to fly by spending 3 magic points per round, but may not cast any other spells while doing so."},{"id":"battle-magic-hammerhand","name":"Hammerhand","school":"Battle Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell endows the cast.er with increased fighting pot.ential. The character may fight in combat with twice as many Attacks, and with a Strength of 2 great.er than normal. The spell lasts for D6 x 10 turns, or until the charact.er suffers the loss of any Wounds, at which point it is automatically dispelled."},{"id":"battle-magic-immunity-from-poison","name":"Immunity from Poison","school":"Battle Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell may be cast either on the caster or on any other single character within 6 yards. It gives the bearer complete immunity from poisons and venoms for between 10 minutes and 1 hour per level of the caster. 1S6"},{"id":"battle-magic-steal-mind","name":"Steal Mind","school":"Battle Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell may be cast against any other single character within 24 yards of the caster. The victim receives a test against Will Power to avoid the spell's effects. Failure results in the target victim becoming utt.erly mindless, unable to do anything but sit on the ground, gibber, dribble and cat grass."},{"id":"battle-magic-strength-of-combat","name":"Strength of Combat","school":"Battle Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows a temporary increase of one of the caster's fighting charact.eristics - WS or BS by + 10; or M, S, T, I or A by + l; or Wounds by D6+ 1 (caster's choice). The effect lasts from the moment the spell is cast until the following morning. Any attempt to cast a second spell on the same charact.er results in the older spell being dispelled, while the new spell works as normal."},{"id":"battle-magic-wind-blast","name":"Wind Blast","school":"Battle Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell causes a terrific blast of wind, aimed specifically at a single character or group within 48 yards. Victims hit by this spell arc knocked off balance for 1 round - during which they may do nothing other than recover balance. In subsequent rounds, they may neither move nor fire tnissiles (but see below)."},{"id":"battle-magic-aura-of-protection","name":"Aura of Protection","school":"Battle Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell provides protection against Wounds by increasing the umber of armour points on each section of the casting, character by + 2. Auras may be dispelled by magical means (eg, Dispel Aura), and are automatically dispelled by hits from magic weapons, so are not a guarantee of invulnerability. Characters may only bear one Aura at any one time, and may dispel it whenever they wish."},{"id":"battle-magic-cause-frenzy","name":"Cause Frenzy","school":"Battle Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell induces frenzy in an individual or group within 48 yards. The victim or victims have to make a test against Will Power or become subject to frenzy for 3D6 rounds. Each round they must make a test against Cool or enter into a frenzied state (see Standard 'Jests)."},{"id":"battle-magic-cause-hatred","name":"Cause Hatred","school":"Battle Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell induces batrf!d into an individual or group within 48 yards. Turget creatures may make a test against Will Power to avoid the spell's effects. Failure results in the victims becoming subject to hatred against any single, enemy group or individual that the caster wishes, for the duration of the spell."},{"id":"battle-magic-cause-panic","name":"Cause Panic","school":"Battle Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell induces panic in any individual or single group within 48 yards. Unless the victim(s) makes a successful test against Will Power, all future tests against Intelligence, Will Power, Cool or Leadership are failed automatically for the duration of the spell. This spell has no affect on creatures not normally affected by psychological reactions, such as Undead."},{"id":"battle-magic-hold-flight","name":"Hold Flight","school":"Battle Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can be cast upon any individual or single group within 48 yards, which is already engaged in combat. It prevents the target of the spell from being routed or otherwise forced to leave combat for the duration of that combat. Characters may, however, run away if they wish to."},{"id":"battle-magic-lightning-bolt","name":"Lightning Bolt","school":"Battle Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell creates an area of mist 12 yards in diameter anywhere within the caster's line of sight. Individuals caught in the mist cannot see out of it or through it, while those outside cannot see into it or past it. Anyone caught in the mist must move at half their normal movement rate, or else wander around randomly within the mist."},{"id":"battle-magic-mystic-mist","name":"Mystic Mist","school":"Battle Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can be cast onto a door, wall or other inanimate surface or object. It does not work on a creature, living or undead. The caster must touch the surface to be affected."},{"id":"battle-magic-smash","name":"Smash","school":"Battle Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"Spell Level: 2 of wall (sec Destroying Buildings). Magic Points: 2 per lightning bolt R ---------------------- 1---------------------. - 57"},{"id":"battle-magic-zone-of-sanctuary","name":"Zone of Sanctuary","school":"Battle Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell creates a 12-yard diameter, magical Zone centred around the caster. The Zone lasts for 1 hour per level of the caster or until the caster moves. All characters inside the Zone become immune to all psychological reactions."},{"id":"battle-magic-zone-of-steadfastness","name":"Zone of Steadfastness","school":"Battle Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell creates a 12 yard diameter Zone centred on the caster. Tlie Zone lasts for 1 hour per level of the caster or until the caster moves. All friendly characters inside the Zone become immune to all psychological effects."},{"id":"battle-magic-animate-sword","name":"Animate Sword","school":"Battle Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster is able to animate a normal, non-magical sword and endow it with a temporary life of its own. The animated sword acts independently of the caster, flying through the air and fighting as the caster wishes. The weapon's profile is: M WS BS S T W A 6 57 O 4 5 6 2 For each round after the first, the caster must expend a further two magic points to maintain the spell,p/us one point for each hit scored on the sword by its opponent(s) during the previous round."},{"id":"battle-magic-arrow-invulnerability","name":"Arrow Invulnerability","school":"Battle Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The spell can be cast on any individual or group of creatures within 48 yards. Turgets may make a Will Power test, and if this is unsuccessful, they must make an immediate test on their Leadership. Failing this test forces the victim to withdraw from combat and run away from the scene of fighting, if possible."},{"id":"battle-magic-cause-cowardly-flight","name":"Cause Cowardly Flight","school":"Battle Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell induces fear in any individual or single group of creatures within 48 yards. Unless they make a successful Will Power test, victims become subject to fear against all potential combat opponents, and have to make the appropriate psychological test whenever a combat is initiated. The effect lasts for 3D6 combat rounds."},{"id":"battle-magic-cause-fear","name":"Cause Fear","school":"Battle Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The hand of a Necromancer or Demonologist"},{"id":"battle-magic-cause-instability","name":"Cause Instability","school":"Battle Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell affects all creatures within sight of the caster which ii\u0007I._, 158 -------------------- .,,.\u0005 -------------------,. are already subject to instability (Ethereal Undead, Demons, Elementals and some Undead). The creatures must make a test against Will Power, or become unstable; roll 1D6 and consult the table given in the Bestiary."},{"id":"battle-magic-cause-stupidity","name":"Cause Stupidity","school":"Battle Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell may be cast at any individual or single group of creatures within 48 yards. The target(s) must make a test against Will Power or be subject to stupidity for the next 3D6 rounds. The victim(s) must make the appropriate psychological test whenever circumstances dictate (see Standard Tests)."},{"id":"battle-magic-curse-of-arrow-attraction","name":"Curse of Arrow Attraction","school":"Battle Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell may be cast at any individual or single group of creatures within 48 yards. Each target may make a test against Will Power to avoid the effects. If the test is failed, the target is cursed for the next hour."},{"id":"battle-magic-dispel-aura","name":"Dispel Aura","school":"Battle Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can be cast against any single character protected by an Aura spell of levels one or two. The character may not make a Magic test to avoid the effects - the Aura is instantly dispelled. This spell does not affect Aura spells of levels three or four."},{"id":"battle-magic-magic-bridge","name":"Magic Bridge","school":"Battle Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell is used to create a solid bridge over any obstacle, such as a river, bog, etc. The spell can be used to create a bridge between the ground and the top of a fortress wall if desired. The bridge begins at the caster's feet, andextends forwards up to a distance of 12 yards per level of the caster."},{"id":"battle-magic-transfer-aura","name":"Transfer Aura","school":"Battle Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"Normally Aura spells can only be cast onto the spellcaster. However, this spell enables the transference of an Aura from the spellcaster to any other character within 4 yards. The character receiving the Aura must make a test against Will Power as though under magical attack, or the spell fails to take effect."},{"id":"battle-magic-aura-of-invulnerability","name":"Aura of Invulnerability","school":"Battle Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"the caster by non-magical weapons. Auras may be dispelled by magical means, and are automatically dispelled by magical weapons, so do not provide complete invulnerability. Characters may only bear one Aura at any one time, and can dispel their own Aura whenever they wish."},{"id":"battle-magic-blast","name":"Blast","school":"Battle Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell is the most powerful of the magic missile spells. Only one blast can be thrown during a round, and it may be targeted at any individual or single group. Target restrictions apply in the same way as for normal missile fire."},{"id":"battle-magic-change-of-allegiance","name":"Change of Allegiance","school":"Battle Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can be cast at any individual or group of hostile creatures within 48 yards. The t2tget receives a test against Will Power to avoid the spell's effects. Affected individuals become enchanted by the caster and effectively 'change sides', treating the caster li1ce a friend or ally."},{"id":"battle-magic-cure-severe-wound","name":"Cure Severe Wound","school":"Battle Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell ls used to heal dther the caster or any other single ehe by touch. The spell takes effect immediately and restores DlO Wounds for every ten magic points used. This spell will work on any single creature, even creatures such as Dragons or other monsters."},{"id":"battle-magic-enchant-weapon","name":"Enchant Weapon","school":"Battle Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to enchant one ordinary weapon by touching it. An enchanted weapon has no special powers, but counts as a magical weapon for the purposes of hitting creatures only affected by magic weapons. The spell lasts for the rest of that day, returning to normal the following daybreak."},{"id":"battle-magic-stand-still","name":"Stand Still","school":"Battle Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can be cast at any individual or group of creatures within 48 yards. Turgets may make a test against Will Power, with failure resulting in them being unable to move, fire missiles, or do anything at all for the following D6 turns."},{"id":"battle-magic-strength-of-mind","name":"Strength of Mind","school":"Battle Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to increase a single personal characteristic (Ld, Int, Cl, WP or Fel -but not Dex) by + 2D8. This lasts for the remain,_der of that day, and ls dispelled at daybreak the following day. This spell can raise abilities to 100 or above."},{"id":"demonology-bind-demon","name":"Bind Demon","school":"Demonology","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can be used against a group of up to 06 Lesser Demons or Demonic Servants, or against a single Greater Demon, within 48 yards. The Demons may make a test against Will Power, and if unsuccessful they are unable to do anything at all during the next game tum (six rounds). The Demons are powerless, being held in complete stasis, and count as prone targets if attacked."},{"id":"demonology-dispel-lesser-demon","name":"Dispel Lesser Demon","school":"Demonology","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to dispel a single Lesser Demon within 24 yards. The Demon receives a test against Will Power to avoid being dispelled, if this is failed the Demon vanishes back to its own plane."},{"id":"demonology-summon-guardian","name":"Summon Guardian","school":"Demonology","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to summon a single Lesser Demon. A Lesser Demon will take the form described in the Bestiary. Once summoned, a Demonic Guardian will appear within 6 yards of the caster."},{"id":"demonology-summon-steed","name":"Summon Steed","school":"Demonology","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to summon a Demonic Steed. The Steed can take many forms, but usually appears in the form of a Warhorse, with flaming eyes and mouth. The Steed has the profile and abilities given under Demonic Servant in the Bestiary."},{"id":"demonology-zone-of-demonic-protection","name":"Zone of Demonic Protection","school":"Demonology","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"the caster. The Zone lasts for 1 hour per levd of the caster or until the caster moves. The caster may forbid any Demons from entering the Zone, from firing missiles and casting or employing magic in the Zone."},{"id":"demonology-stop-demonic-instability","name":"Stop Demonic Instability","school":"Demonology","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can be cast onto any group of Lesser Demons or Demonic Servants, or on a single Greater Demon within 48 yards. The target will be unaffected by its next period of Instability (see the Bestiary - Instability), even if magically induced. A group of Demons may only be protected by one of these spells at a time."},{"id":"demonology-summon-energy","name":"Summon Energy","school":"Demonology","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"this spell to summon magical power of Demonic origin. The energy appears as a writhing mist, and the caster must make a successful Will Power test to absorb the magical energy. If the test is successful, the energy increases the caster's magic points by 4D6, but will not take the total beyond the caster's Power Level."},{"id":"demonology-summon-lesser-demons","name":"Summon Lesser Demons","school":"Demonology","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster can use this spell to summon a group of 3D6 Lesser Demons, which will appear within 6 yards. However, this spell may oIy be cast if one of the Demons has previously been summoned, controlled, and a bargain struck with it - following the rules given under Summoning Demons (see above). If the caster successfully controls the Demons (making one Will Power check for each Demon), they will serve for 1 hour per level of the caster, at which time they return to their own plane."},{"id":"demonology-summon-magical-aid","name":"Summon Magical Aid","school":"Demonology","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster can use this spell to summon demonic aid in the form of a spell. The aid appears as a writhing mist, and the Demonologist must make a successful Will Power test to absorb the spell. If the test is successful, one Battle Magic or Demonic spell t,f the caster's own level or lower may be learned temporarily."},{"id":"demonology-zone-of-demonic-nullification","name":"Zone of Demonic Nullification","school":"Demonology","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The spell creates a 6 yard diameter Zone centred around the caster. The Zone lasts for an hour per level of the caster or until the caster moves. Any Demon within the Zone, or who attempts to enter the 7.onc, instantly becomes unstable and disappears."},{"id":"demonology-dispel-demon-horde","name":"Dispel Demon Horde","school":"Demonology","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to dispel any single group of Lesser Demons within 48 yards. Each Demon receives a test against Will Power and instantly returns to its own plane if this is failed."},{"id":"demonology-spread-insanity","name":"Spread Insanity","school":"Demonology","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell produces an awesome awareness of diabolic power in all living creatures within 24 yards of the caster. Every creature within this area which fails a test against Will Power must make an immediate test on its Leadership. Any creatures failing the test will instantly flee away from the caster and will not return for at least 10D6 game turns."},{"id":"demonology-summon-demon-horde","name":"Summon Demon Horde","school":"Demonology","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster can use this spell to summon a group of 6D6 Lesser Demons. The group appears within 6 yards of the caster. This spell may only be cast, however, if one of the Demons has previously been summoned, controlled, and a bargain struck with it, according to the rules given under Summoning Demons."},{"id":"demonology-summon-great-power","name":"Summon Great Power","school":"Demonology","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster may use this spell to summon pure power of demonic origin. The energy appears as a writhing mist, and the Demonologist must make a successful Will Power test to absorb it successfully. If the test is successful, the energy increases all the caster's characteristics by + 1 or + 10 as appropriate."},{"id":"demonology-demonic-portal","name":"Demonic Portal","school":"Demonology","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell opens up a portal between the natural world and a demonic world, allowing uncontrolled Demon hordes to pass unhindered. The portal appears anywhere witGin 48 yards of the caster. The caster cannot control the Demons that appear."},{"id":"demonology-dispel-greater-demon","name":"Dispel Greater Demon","school":"Demonology","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to dispel a single Greater Demon within 24 yards. The Demon may make a test against Will Power and if failed the Demon is instantly dispelled to its own plane.  \u0003j. 165"},{"id":"demonology-summon-greater-demon","name":"Summon Greater Demon","school":"Demonology","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster can use this spell to summon a single Greater Demon. The creature appears within 6 yards of the caster. However, this spell may only be cast if the Demon has already been summoned, controlled, and bargained with -according to the rules given under Summoning Demons."},{"id":"demonology-summon-total-power","name":"Summon Total Power","school":"Demonology","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"this spell to summon pure, unadulterated power of demonic origin. The energy appears as a writhing mist, and the caster must make a Will Power test in order to absorb it. If the test is successful, the energy increases all the caster's characteristics by + 2 or + 20 as applicable."},{"id":"elemental-magic-assault-of-stones","name":"Assault of Stones","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"A character using this spell causes an assault of stones to burst upon any individual or group of enemies within 48 yards. This is a magic missile attack, causmg damage like missile weapons. 'Iluget restrictions apply in the same way as for normal missile fire. An.AJisault of Stones automatically bits its target causing 06 Wounds at Strength 4."},{"id":"elemental-magic-blinding-flash","name":"Blinding Flash","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell causes temporary blindness in all creatures within 12 yards of the caster. The spell takes effect immediately and lasts. or 1 combat round. Blinded characters may still move, but in a randomly-chosen direction at quarter J>2Ce."},{"id":"elemental-magic-breathe-underwater","name":"Breathe Underwater","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell may be used on the caster or another character by touch. It allows the individual to breath in any atmosphere, under water or even in a complete vacuum. Airborne poisons have no affect on the character."},{"id":"elemental-magic-cloud-of-smoke","name":"Cloud of Smoke","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell creates a cloud of smoke with a radius of 6 yards, centred on the Elementalist. The cloud does not move with the caster, but remains stationary. The cloud will last for D6 rounds, and disperses at the end of the last round."},{"id":"elemental-magic-hand-of-fire","name":"Hand of Fire","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell causes the caster's wc:2p0ns to bum with a flickering flame. In combat, all hits count as magical (ie, they will inflict damage on creatures immune to non-magical weapons), at + 1 Strength, whilst any hit on a flammable target inflicts an additional 104 iunds. The spell takes effect immediately and lasts for 1 hour per level of the caster or until the user dispels it."},{"id":"elemental-magic-magic-light","name":"Magic Light","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell proauces a ntaKlc light from the caster's hand, which will illumfuatc an area wfth a radius of 15 yards. The light lasts until dispelled, or until the caster grasps an object. A magic light can also be thrown a distance of up to 12 yards."},{"id":"elemental-magic-walk-on-water","name":"Walk on Water","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to walk on water. It takes effect as soon as the character steps onto the water and is dispelled as soon as the character steps onto dry land. The spell also allows the character to traverse marshes, pools, and so on, with no movement penalty for crossing difficult ground."},{"id":"elemental-magic-zone-of-hiding","name":"Zone of Hiding","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell creates a magical Zone with a diameter of 6 yards, centred on the caster, which lasts for 1 hour per level of the caster, until it is destroyed, or until the caster moves. All creatures inside the Zone assume a chameleon-like appearance, merging with the surrounding tcrnlin. So long as they remain stationary, they arc impossible to sec at distances of above 12 yards, and below this range any missile shots arc fired with a -20 BS penalty."},{"id":"elemental-magic-cause-fire","name":"Cause Fire","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster can cause any one source of flammable material within 48 yards to burst into flames, suffering 10 + D6 Wounds instantly. this spell may be directed against any one flammable creature, such as a Mummy, in wh  h case it may make a Magic test to negate the spell 's effects 167"},{"id":"elemental-magic-cause-rain","name":"Cause Rain","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to create a sudden torrential burst of rain, even in underground settings or inside buildings. This takes effect immediately and lasts for 1 round. The spell will reduce fire damage by 2D4 points (see Fire)."},{"id":"elemental-magic-clap-of-thunder","name":"Clap of Thunder","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster causes a loud clap of thunder, audible over a great <&tance - at least 2,000 yards above ground, somewhat less if underground or in an urban environment. All creatures subject to stupidity and all creatures with an Intelligence of 3 or less must make a fear test - as if being charged by something they fear. Mounted animals, or those with handlers do not need to test."},{"id":"elemental-magic-extinguish-fire","name":"Extinguish Fire","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can be used to try to put out fires, such as burning buildings. The spell can be directed against any one section of a burning building, or at a burning character within 200 yards. The fire is immediately extinguished."},{"id":"elemental-magic-move-object","name":"Move Object","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can produce aerial drafts, enabling the caster to slam shut doors or move light objects such as parchments, curtains, and so on. The Elementalist can open or close any unlocked or unbolted door within 24 yards, or move any unsecured lightweight item (with 10 encumbrance points or less) a distance of up to 12 yards."},{"id":"elemental-magic-part-water","name":"Part Water","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster may employ this spell against any river or body of water up to 8 yards wide within 48 yards. The river will instantly part, producing a gap of 8 yards width which can be crossed on foot. The water will remain parted until the caster dispels it (which can be done at any time) or until the caster moves more than 48 yards away."},{"id":"elemental-magic-raise-fire","name":"Raise Fire","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"this spell on themselves. It protects them against damage from fire or flaming weapons. Any firebased attack, including Fire Balls and magical weapons with a flame attack, have no effect at all."},{"id":"elemental-magic-wither-vegetation","name":"Wither Vegetation","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster can use this spell against any section of vegetation (trees or bushes) within 48 yards. The spell affects an area 8 yards by 8 yards (larger areas require two spells). The affected section instantly withers away to nothing. LEVEL THREE"},{"id":"elemental-magic-banish-elemental","name":"Banish Elemental","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to dispel a single Elemental within 24 yards. The Elemental may make a test against Will Power, to avoid the effects of the spell. If the test is failed, the Elemental is instantly dispelled."},{"id":"elemental-magic-become-ethereal","name":"Become Ethereal","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster can use this spell to enter an ethereal state. Once ethereal, the caster cannot use magic, Meditation skill, attack in combat or use missile weapons, but may, however, move through solid objects (such as walls), and cross obstacles or difficult ground, including water, without penalty. An ethereal character can also become visible or invisible at will."},{"id":"elemental-magic-breathe-fire","name":"Breathe Fire","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster gains the ability to breathe fire three times during the rest of the day. Fire breath can be aimed at a group or character within 24 yards - subject to the normal rules for targeting spells. The breath is cone-shaped (see the Bestiary - Dragon), 24 yards long and 4 yards wide at its widest point."},{"id":"elemental-magic-create-quicksand","name":"Create Quicksand","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"Spell Level: 3 Magic Points: 9"},{"id":"elemental-magic-crumble-stone","name":"Crumble Stone","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"the caster or until dispelled. 1&11J.1.-11It>I"},{"id":"elemental-magic-dust-storm","name":"Dust Storm","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"this spell, the caster can crush stone bare-handed, or affect any stone or brick building, stttue, and so on, as follows. A statue may be destroyed with just a single touch, while each touch on an 8 yard long section of wall inflicts D6 damage points regardless of the wall's Toughness (see Destroying Buildings). The ability remains for 1 hour per level of the caster, or until the character casts another spell."},{"id":"elemental-magic-flame-sheet","name":"Flame Sheet","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to create a Dust Storm with a radius of 6 yards, centred anywhere within 24 yards of the character. The Dust Storm may be moved by the caster. The Storm may move over creatures, and is not be slowed by difficult terrain."},{"id":"elemental-magic-foul-air","name":"Foul Air","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster can create a pocket of foul air with a radius of up to 12 yards, centred anywhere within 48 yards. All creatures in this area must make a successful Poison test each round or suffer the effects of 1 dose of the toxin wblcb Is most effective against tbat type of creature (see Fblson ). In other words, the foul air has the effects of all known toxins, and works on all nonmagical animals with the same potency as spider venom."},{"id":"elemental-magic-animate-water","name":"Animate Water","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"this spell, the caster can animate any single body of water within 48 yards. The maximum area of water which may be affected is a 6-yard radius circle, but this may be part of a much larger body of water such as a river or lake, the bulk of which will not be affected. The animated water will manifest up to 12 pseudopods, each up to 24 yards long, with which it may make up to 12 attacks."},{"id":"elemental-magic-dispel-elementals","name":"Dispel Elementals","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster can use this spell to dispel all Etementals within 48 yards. Affected creatures may make a test against Will Power to avoid being dispelled."},{"id":"elemental-magic-hedge-of-thorns","name":"Hedge of Thorns","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell enables the caster to create a hedge of thorns anywhere within 48 yards. The hedge will instantly spring up from the ground, filling an area in a 2 x 24 yard strip or a circle with a radius of 6 yards. The hedge can be made to grow up in front of, around or even on top of groups of creatures if the caster wishes."},{"id":"elemental-magic-summon-elemental","name":"Summon Elemental","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell will summon a singleElemental of Earth, Air, Fire or Water to appear within 6 yards of the caster. The caster must attempt to control the Elemental by making a test against Will Power. If successful, the Elemental will obey any simple commands given by the Elementalist."},{"id":"elemental-magic-summon-elemental-horde","name":"Summon Elemental Horde","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"this spell to summon a group of Elementals of Earth, Air, Fire or Water. The Elementalist may only summon Elementals of one type at a time. 03 + 1 Elementals of the desired type will appear as a group within 6 yards of the summoner. The Elementalist must attempt to control each one in tum by making a test against Will Power."},{"id":"elemental-magic-summon-swarm","name":"Summon Swarm","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the Elementalist to command natural creatures. The Elementalist can summon a Swarm of either beetles, snakes and lizards, spiders, rats, frogs and toads, ants, ticks, scorpions or bats (see the BestiarySwarm). The Swarm appears within 6 yards of the summoner and will follow simple instructions."},{"id":"elemental-magic-tunnel-through-stone","name":"Tunnel Through Stone","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to tunnel through the ground or walls, without needing to use tools. The tunnel thus created is magically stabilised, will not colapse and causes no damage to buildings. The caster may even tunnel through soft sand or mud using this spell, or may move through solid rock at normal pace, creating a tunnel wide enough for a single person."},{"id":"elemental-magic-wall-shaker","name":"Wall Shaker","school":"Elemental Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster can use this spell to cause all building sections within 24 yards to collapse. Creatures inside or on top of a collapsing building receive 06 + 3 wounds with normal modifiers for Toughness and armour (head or body only). ILLUSIONIST SPELLS 171"},{"id":"illusionist-magic-assume-illusionary-appearance","name":"Assume Illusionary Appearance","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster may assume the appearance of any other, living, bipedal creature under 10 feet in height. The caster can appear in the guise of a specific individual if desired. Anyone viewing the illusion may make an Intelligence test to attempt to see through it."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-bewilder-foe","name":"Bewilder Foe","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can be cast on any single individual within 24 yards. It is not an illusion as such and does not interfere with the maintenance of other illusions. The t:uget may make a normal Magic test to negate the spell's effects."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-camouflage-illusion","name":"Camouflage Illusion","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"the caster is 2 yards away from his or her actual position. This makes the caster a very difficult target to hit in hand-to-hand combat or by missile fire; attackers suffer a penalty of -10 to both WS and BS. The spell moves with the caster, but any character viewing the illusion when the caster moves is allowed a test against Intelligence to see through the illusion."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-cloak-activity","name":"Cloak Activity","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"the caster to perform any act whilst appearing to do something completely different. The lliusionist appears to be occupying the same space, engaged in seemingly innocent activities. For ex.imple, while the caster was actually striking another charactei; all other characters would see the caster apparently quietly whistling or talking."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-clone-image","name":"Clone Image","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"the caster This spell allows the lliusionist to create one or more clone images, up to a maximum of 1 image per level. When the spell is cast, the lliusionist will appear to split into 2, 3 or more identical images - only one of which is the real lliusionist. The images always stay within 2 yards of the caster."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-banish-illusion","name":"Banish Illusion","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster may use this spell against any group of creatures,. ingle character or object within 48 yards which he or she suspects of being an illusion. There is a base 50 % that the spell will destroy any target illusion, modified as follows. For each level by which the caster of the Banish spell exceeds the caster of the illusion, increase the chance of success by 10%."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-confound-foe","name":"Confound Foe","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The spell has the effect of negating all combat damage sustained during that round, just as if it didn't really happen - because It didn't!"},{"id":"illusionist-magic-ghostly-appearance","name":"Ghostly Appearance","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the Illusionist to assume the appearance of any Undead creature. The caster can take the guise of a specific individual, if so desired. This does not prevent the Illusionist from casting spells as normal."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-hallucinate","name":"Hallucinate","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell may be cast at any group or individual within 48 yards. The targets may make a Will Power test to avoid the effects of the spell. If this is failed, the individuals see themselves being charged by any creature of the caster's choosing."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-illusionary-buildings","name":"Illusionary Buildings","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"the caster to create the appearance of a group of buildings anywhere within 1,200 yards (approximately two thirds of a mile, 6oo tabletop inches, or 50 tabletop feet). Each 8 x 8 yard building section costs two magic points to reproduce. The illusion may take the form of a village, farmstead, or whatever the caster chooses."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-illusionary-woods","name":"Illusionary Woods","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"the caster to create the appearance of a wood anywhere within 1,200 yards (approximately two thirds of a mile, 600 tabletop inches, or 50 tabletop feet). Each 12 x 12 yard section costs 5 Magic points to reproduce. Creatures covered by the illusion will be hidden from view but can see out of the 'woods' normally."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-illusionary-enemy","name":"Illusionary Enemy","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell creates an illusion of a group of either up to 24 humanoid creatures, or ten Undead, or a sinale monster or Lesser Demon. The illusion appears within 48 yards of the caster, and is controlled by the Illusionist as if it were real. The image(s) may reproduce any of the special abilities and/or psychological affects of the real creature."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-illusion-of-mighty-appearance","name":"Illusion of Mighty Appearance","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the Illusionist to assume the appearance of any creature desired, reproducing its special abilities and/or psychological affects. Anyone viewing the illusion may make an Intelligence test to see through it. The spell lasts for 5D6 minutes, but may be renewed at any time by the spending of further magic points."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-universal-confusion","name":"Universal Confusion","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"the caster's line of sight. The effects start from the round after the spell is cast and last for that round only. Victims suffer complete disorientation and may only move at half pace, wandering around almlessly with no idea of where they arc."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-vanish","name":"Vanish","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"A golden hoop of at least 6\" diameter"},{"id":"illusionist-magic-destroy-illusions","name":"Destroy Illusions","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster may do nothing while in The Illusionist creates an illusion of complete darkness in a cirthe other dimension, but is able to see events in the place le-e with a diameter of 24 yards, centred anywhere within 96 174 \u0005 behind. The Illusionist may decide to return to the scene of the action at any time before the spell expires, but must return to within 24 yards of the exact point where the spell was used. If the spell expires while the Illusionist is in the other dimension, the Illusionist is expellc;d from the dimension in a randomly chosen location, 4D6 yards from where the spell was cast."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-illusionary-army","name":"Illusionary Army","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"this spell is cast, all illusions within 1,200 yards (6o0 tabletop inches, or 50 tabletop feet) currently maintained by any and all characters are instantly dispelled. This spell affects illusions maintained by the caster."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-illusion-of-darkness","name":"Illusion of Darkness","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"the caster The caster creates an illusion of 2D6 groups each comprising up to 20 humanoid or Undead troops. These groups appear within sight of the caster, and can be controlled and moved as if real. Characters viewing the troops may make an Intelligence test for each group."},{"id":"illusionist-magic-teleport","name":"Teleport","school":"Illusionist Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell is similar to the Vanish spell, allowing the caster to briefly enter another dimension for 2D6 rounds. The caster may return to the scene of action or may, instead, return to a point anywhere within 100 miles of the spot where the spell was cast - assuming the filusionist has been in that place at least once before (home or a safe place, for example). This spell may not be used more than three times in a day."},{"id":"necromantic-magic-destroy-undead","name":"Destroy Undead","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can be cast against any group of Skeletons, Zombies or Ethereal Undead within 24 yards, and will affect 1D6 of the group. The creatures may make a test against Will Power to avoid either crumbling to dust or (in the case of Ethereal Undead) simply vanishing. Undead which successfully make the test are unaffected by the spell."},{"id":"necromantic-magic-hand-of-death","name":"Hand of Death","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell endows the caster with the ability to cause Wounds simply by touching a target. The caster rolls to hit -ignoring normal unarmed combat modifiers - and any hit automatically causes 1D6 'Wounds to the target, irrespective of Toughness or armour (unless magical - sec below), in addition to any normal damage (which is subject to the usual modifiers). Each successful touch costs a further 1 magic point."},{"id":"necromantic-magic-summon-skeletal-champion","name":"Summon Skeletal Champion","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell is used to summon a single Skeleton Champion, which appears within six yards of the summoner. This spell may be cast to animate an available corpse or - provided the necessary preparations have been made (see Summoning Undead, above) to draw a hero from the plane of death. Gamesmasters may determine the Champion's profile by using the guidelines given in the Bestiary, or use the following: Once summoned, the Champion stays undl dawn the following day, when it crumbles into dust."},{"id":"necromantic-magic-summon-skeletons","name":"Summon Skeletons","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell is used to summon a group of D6 normal Skeletons. If cast on a battlefield or burial site, the Skeletons spring up in a group around the caster. If summoned using an enchanted skull, they appear within 6 yards of the summoner."},{"id":"necromantic-magic-zone-of-life","name":"Zone of Life","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell creates a magical field, 12 yards in diameter, centred on the caster. The Zone lasts one hour per level of the caster or undl the caster moves. The caster may forbid any Undead (including Ethereal Undead) from entering the Zone, or from firing missiles or casting magic into the Zone While maintaining a Zone, a character may not cast any new spells or use Meditation skill to recover magic points."},{"id":"necromantic-magic-control-undead","name":"Control Undead","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell may be cast againstr:k group of Skeletons or Zombies within 48 yards. Turgcts may c a test agait).st Will Power to resist the effects. Individual Undead which fail their Magic test are taken over by the caster."},{"id":"necromantic-magic-extended-control","name":"Extended Control","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell enables the caster to extend the normal range of Undead control from 24 to 48 yards. The spell lasts for 1 hour per level of the caster. llANDOFDUST"},{"id":"necromantic-magic-hand-of-dust","name":"Hand of Dust","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell endows the caster with the ability to cause Wounds simply by touching a target (use of a weapon negates the effects). The caster rolls to bit as normal  ignoring unarmed combat modifiers - and any hit automatically causes 2D6 Wounds (irrespective of Toughness and armour), in addition to any normal damage. This spell takes effect immediately, and lasts until the caster is wounded, when it is instantly dispelled."},{"id":"necromantic-magic-stop-instability","name":"Stop Instability","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can be cast on any group of Undead or ethereal creatures within 48 yards. The creatures ignore their next occurance of Instability, even if magically induced. Only one such spell may be carried by a group at any one time."},{"id":"necromantic-magic-summon-skeleton-minor-hero","name":"Summon Skeleton Minor Hero","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster can use this spell to summon a single Skeleton Minor Hero who appears within 6 yards. A Skeleton Minor Hero can act as a leader/controller for an tJndcad unit in the same w:ay as a Necromancer. Gamesmasters may determine the basic profile of the creature according to the guidelines given in the Bestiary, or use the following: Once summoned the Hero stays until the next sunrise, when it collapses into dust. LEVEL THREE"},{"id":"necromantic-magic-annihilate-undead","name":"Annihilate Undead","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell affects all Undead (including Ethereal Undead) within 24 yards of the caster. Any such creatures must make a test against Will Power or be destroyed."},{"id":"necromantic-magic-life-in-death","name":"Life in Death","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell may only affect the caster. Its effects last for 1 hour per level of the caster. If slain during this time, the Necromancer's spirit is released and may try to inhabit the body of any other living creature during the next 2D4 combat rounds."},{"id":"necromantic-magic-raise-dead","name":"Raise Dead","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell must be cast within a graveyard or burial ground of some kind. The magician can raise one of the following groups of undead creatures: 6D6 Skeletons, 6D6 Zombies, 3D6 Ghouls or D6 Mummies. The Undead will always appear as a single group."},{"id":"necromantic-magic-summon-skeleton-horde","name":"Summon Skeleton Horde","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster can use this spell to summon a horde of 6D6 Skeletons. The creatures will be normal Skeletons in a single group (see Undead -The Bestiary), and will appear within 6 yards of the summoner. LEVEL FOUR"},{"id":"necromantic-magic-curse-of-undeath","name":"Curse of Undeath","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell may be cast against apy character within 48 yards. The victim may make a test against Will Power to avoid the effects. ff this is failed, the victim begins to be transformed into an Unde2d creature. At the beginning of each subsequent game round, the victim loses one point of Strength, and if this reaches zero, the victim becomes one of the Undead, with the character's origi112l Strength score, but Will Power, Dexterity, and Fellowship dropped to 10, and any magic powers possessed by the victim lost."},{"id":"necromantic-magic-summon-skeleton-major-hero","name":"Summon Skeleton Major Hero","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster can use this spell to summon a single Skeleton Major Hero, which will appear within 6 yards of the Necromancer. A Skeleton Major Hero can act as a leader/ controller for an Undead unit in the same way as a Necromancer. You may generate the creature's profile according to the guidelines given in the Bestiary, or use the one given below: A fl BS S T W 53 47 4 4"},{"id":"necromantic-magic-total-control","name":"Total Control","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to extend the normal range of Undead control to cover an area with a radius of 2400 yards (about a mile and a half). The spell is effective until dawn of the following day,"},{"id":"necromantic-magic-wind-of-death","name":"Wind of Death","school":"Necromantic Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell causes a swirling, black wind of death to blow over an area of radius 2,400 yards (about a mile and a half). The wind sucks the life energy from all living creatures, causing 2D6 Wounds (regardless of Toughness and armour) on every living creature it passes over, including the caster. Armour does not reduce this damage and no Magic test is allowed"},{"id":"druidic-magic-animal-mastery","name":"Animal Mastery","school":"Druidic Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to make telepathic contact with any non-fantastic anim21 of low intelligencEe?\"o!!/ within 6 yards. The caster may communicate with the  freely, and may be able to command it; most animals contacted by this means will be basically well-disposed toward the caster, but the GM should make a Will Power test for the animal if the caster commands it to do anything which is dangerous or outside its normal behaviour patterns. The spell lasts for 1 tum, but may be extended by the expenditure of additional magic points. 1\\\u0017\u0018,\u0019;w;fa:\u001a;;;};::\\;;\u001b,."},{"id":"druidic-magic-cure-poison","name":"Cure Poison","school":"Druidic Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell may be cast either on the caster or on any other single creature that the caster can touch. The spell negates the effect of one poisoned wound or dose of poison, provided that it is cast within one hour of the poison being administered."},{"id":"druidic-magic-delouse","name":"Delouse","school":"Druidic Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to remove parasitic infestations of all kinds from any one creature touched by the Druidic Priest."},{"id":"druidic-magic-heal-animal","name":"Heal Animal","school":"Druidic Magic","level":"1","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell restores one non-fantastic, non-giant animal to full health, counteracting wounds, poisons, disease, and so on. The caster must be able to touch the animal during the casting of the spell. This spell will not restore dead animals to life, nor will it remove the effects of critical hits. LEVEL TWO"},{"id":"druidic-magic-giant-animal-mastery","name":"Giant Animal Mastery","school":"Druidic Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell is similar to the first level spell Animal Mastery, except that it affects non-fantastic giant anim21s (giant rats, giant spiders, etc). Giant animals are permitted a test against Will Power to resist the caster's commands. 180"},{"id":"druidic-magic-hail-storm","name":"Hail Storm","school":"Druidic Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster causes a sudden and violent hailstorm, even if underground or inside buildings. Anyone caught in the hailstorm takes D6 Wounds at Strength 0, and must make a test against Cool every round in order to be able to attack (rather than looking for cover, holding shields over heads, and so on). Wounds are taken either on the head or shoulders (chest) with a 50% chance of each."},{"id":"druidic-magic-shapechange","name":"Shapechange","school":"Druidic Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell allows the caster to take the form of any non-fantastic, non-giant animal. The caster gains all the characteristic scores of the animal in question ( except Intelligence which is unchanged), together with any abilities that the animal might have If rendered unconscious by Wound loss or any other means, the caster reverts to Human form. While in animal form, the Druidic Priest cannot cast spells or perform any other actions of which the animal is not capable."},{"id":"druidic-magic-tanglethorn","name":"Tanglethorn","school":"Druidic Magic","level":"2","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The Druidic Priest can cause an area of plants or bushes up to 4 times the level of the caster in square yards, to become partially animated. For CD1Dple, a 2nd Level Druidic Priest may animate 8 square yards. The plants will lash out and hold anything trying to move through them."},{"id":"druidic-magic-animate-tree","name":"Animate Tree","school":"Druidic Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell enables the caster to animate one tree; effectively it becomes a 'Ilceman under the caster's control. The animated tree has all the characteristics and abilities of a lrecman, as detailed in the BestJary. The caster must touch the tree to effect the transformation, and must maintain concentration while the tree is animated; the Druidic Priest may move, but fighting or spellcasting breaks concentration, as does being wounded."},{"id":"druidic-magic-decompose","name":"Decompose","school":"Druidic Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"On the casting of this spell, a ray of dark green light is projected from the caster's fingertips, up to a range of 48 yards. Anything organic in the path of the ray (such as wood, leather and items of clothing) will rot and tum to dust instantaneously. If cast against cuctcrs or monsters' clothing or armour, they are allowed a tesU against Will Power to avoid the spell's effects."},{"id":"druidic-magic-tap-earthpower","name":"Tap Earthpower","school":"Druidic Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"This spell can only'bc cast while in a stone dtcle (sec Religion and Belief - Tbe Old Faltb). It enables the caster to draw upon the earth-power of the stone circle and use it for spell-casting. The caster rc_sains D4 magic points per round while in the stone circle, though the circle will not increase magic points above the Druidic Priest's Power Level."},{"id":"druidic-magic-zone-of-purity","name":"Zone of Purity","school":"Druidic Magic","level":"3","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The spell creates a 12-yard diameter Zone centred around the caster. The Zone lasts either for 1 houi; 6r until it is destroyed, or until the-caster moves. Druidic Priests and normal animals may enter and leave the Zone freely; everything else must make a successful Will Power test or be excluded."},{"id":"druidic-magic-cure-body","name":"Cure Body","school":"Druidic Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"The caster may create an area of soft and marshy ground up to 48 yards away. This spell can only be cast out of doors, on areas of bare ground; it has no effect on rock or stone. The bog covers an area ofup to 48 square yards, and counts as difficult ground (see Movement)."},{"id":"druidic-magic-create-sacred-grove","name":"Create Sacred Grove","school":"Druidic Magic","level":"4","magicPoints":0,"range":"","duration":"","ingredients":"","description":"Sacred Groves arc the temples of the Druidic Priests and a full description can be found in Religion and Belief -The Old Faith. This spell allows the Druidic Priest to create a Sacred Grove, or to re-dedicate one that has been desecrated. Before this spell can be cast, the area must be marked out using the 3rd level spell Zone of Purity."}];
